-| 管理费用 | Administrative Expenses | Costs to maintain daily operations, such as salary expense. | M03 §2.5.3 | |
-| 财务费用 | Finance Costs | Costs incurred in maintaining debt finances (bank loans, etc.). | M03 §2.5.3 | |
-| 营业利润 | Profit from Operations / Operating Income | Gross profit plus other income and gains, less distribution, administration and other expenses. | M03 §2.5.2 | |
-| 税前利润 | Profit before Tax | Profit from operations less finance costs. | M03 §2.5.2 | |
-| 每股收益 | Earnings Per Share (EPS) | Profit attributable to ordinary equity holders **of the parent** divided by the weighted average number of shares outstanding; reported basic and diluted. | M03 §2.5.2 | |
