-| 经常性 / 非经常性项目 | Recurring / Nonrecurring Items | Items that will / will not repeat; only recurring items can be extrapolated to the future. | M03 §2.5.4 | |
-| 盈余质量 | Quality of Earnings | The extent to which reported earnings are real, sustainable and cash-backed; *"Figures could be manipulated: the quality of earnings may be low."* | M03 §2.5.4 | |
